#+
# Renders the TI5X Android launcher icons (legacy mipmaps, round mipmaps and
# adaptive-icon foregrounds) from the same flat design as the former MAUI app
# icon: a dark rounded tile with a TI-59 calculator mock-up, red LED display
# and gold key rows.
#
# NOTE: this flat design has been superseded - the shipped icons are now
# rendered from docs/ti-59.svg by util/makeicons-ti59. Running this script
# would overwrite them.
#
# The drawing is done in pure Python (3x supersampled rectangles, box-filter
# downsampling, hand-rolled PNG encoder) so the output is deterministic and
# needs no external SVG rasterizer.
#
# Invoke as follows (writes into src/TI5X.Avalonia.Android/Resources):
#
#     makeicons
